{"pos":26723,"endPos":26747,"startLine":579,"startLineOffset":50,"endLine":579,"endLineOffset":74,"length":25}]},{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java--25460:25466","promptId":"#Q6EHF","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":25460,"endPos":25466,"startLine":554,"startLineOffset":46,"endLine":554,"endLineOffset":52,"length":7}]},{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java--26122:26146","promptId":"#0N4H7","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":26122,"endPos":26146,"startLine":568,"startLineOffset":46,"endLine":568,"endLineOffset":70,"length":25}]}]},{"comment":"The new logic in `parseNonDynamicArray` checks if the source needs to be rebuilt on the fly and if the mapper stores array source. This introduces a dependency on the `sourceTracked` flag in `DocumentParserContext`. Ensure that this flag is correctly set and reset as needed throughout the parsing process.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java--27087:27110,27213:27966","promptId":"#9H8GF","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParser.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":27087,"endPos":27110,"startLine":591,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":591,"endLineOffset":31,"length":24},{"pos":27213,"endPos":27966,"startLine":595,"startLineOffset